flowchart TB
    accTitle: What a request to Paperless ends in
    accDescr: The Paperless client asks Paperless for a page of documents. A request without an answer gets one second try only when it failed within 3.5 seconds, before it had a connection, and Nextcloud didn't refuse its address; a request that waited for a Paperless that hangs fails the search at once. An answer of 2xx brings the documents. HTTP 400 for the query, as for an advanced query that the user is still typing, or HTTP 404 for a page after the first, is no problem of the search, and the history stays untouched; on Paperless 3, the client asks once more with the same term in the simple mode of the search, which brings the documents of its words, finds nothing when refused again, and fails the search with any other answer. Every other answer fails the search, which the history notes.

    request(["`**Ask Paperless**`"])
    answered{"Did Paperless<br>answer?"}
    early{"Within 3.5 s, before<br>a connection, and no<br>refused local address?"}
    second["One second try;<br>its answer notes a retry"]
    status{"Which status?"}
    documents["The documents"]
    paperless3{"Paperless 3<br>and HTTP 400?"}
    simple["The same term in the<br>simple mode, text"]
    nothing["Nothing found,<br>the history untouched"]
    failed["The search failed,<br>noted in the history"]

    request --> answered
    answered -- "no" --> early
    early -- "yes" --> second
    early -- "no" --> failed
    second -- "no answer" --> failed
    second -- "answer" --> status
    answered -- "yes" --> status
    status -- "2xx" --> documents
    status -- "400 for the query,<br>404 for a later page" --> paperless3
    status -- "any other" --> failed
    paperless3 -- "yes" --> simple
    paperless3 -- "no" --> nothing
    simple -- "2xx" --> documents
    simple -- "refused again" --> nothing
    simple -- "any other" --> failed

    classDef yes fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef no fill:#dc26262e,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    class documents,nothing yes
    class failed no
